The '''Imperial Trench''' was a part of [[Ilum]] where the [[Galactic Empire]] gouged out a large portion of the [[planet]] as part of their [[mining]] operations of the planet's [[kyber crystal]]s. It was visible from [[orbit]]<ref name="Fallen Order" /> by [[14 BBY]].<ref name="Date" />

The trench was later used by the [[First Order]] to house the [[Starkiller Base]] [[superweapon]].<ref name="TROSVD" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Imperial Trench first appeared in [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']]<ref name="TFA">{{Film|VII}}</ref> and was later identified in the [[2019]] [[Star Wars video games|video game]] ''[[Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order]]''.<ref name="Fallen Order" />

